      "role": "user",
      "content": "hi, i'm working through some samples from a recent excavation in the Peloponnese. i've got a lot of ceramic shards from a single stratum but i'm having trouble distinguishing between the different firing techniques used. what are the main physical indicators i should be looking for to tell if a piece was fired in an oxidizing vs reducing atmosphere?",
